(text "PCB MATCH" (at 20.32 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "f04bcb28-09b0-5343-b333-74a856ebe7a7"))
(text "Pins 4 and 24 restored: ZS_XM_Q2 and ZS_XP_Q4. All 40 pins are passive electrode contacts." (at 20.32 159.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "af02568a-85fe-55c8-8ea1-845d82dda2ec"))
(text "The Pxx_ prefix preserves each existing PCB net. Ground and duplicate electrodes remain separate nets." (at 20.32 164.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "dcf1f2cd-2d81-5de2-a237-c15a10a57dbe"))
(text "Drive range: -50 V to +50 V. Existing board geometry, cutout and routing are retained." (at 20.32 169.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "22a75aca-5074-5746-907a-621d38a5985e"))
(text "Add drive/readout circuitry as needed. No no-connect flags are placed on the chip." (at 20.32 174.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "208fbe99-779f-500a-9591-f7a0700fd2b6"))
